Sabse important line:

DNS ka primary purpose human-friendly domain names ko network addresses (jaise IP addresses) se resolve karna hai.

Aur ek important distinction: DNS website ko download nahi karta — DNS pehle naam ka address resolve karta hai; uske baad browser us IP par actual network connection establish karta hai.
